{"additions":2,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Release v0.6.0\n\n## Changes since v0.5.0\n- ✨ GitHub view: sub-issues are nested under their parent issue as a tree (#80, #83)\n- ✨ GitHub view: PRs in a GitHub Stack (`gh stack`) are nested bottom-to-top under the PR they build on (#81, #84)\n\nMerging this PR triggers the release workflow (tag → GitHub Release → crates.io publish → binaries → Homebrew formula).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T04:55:08Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.6.0","labels":[],"number":86,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABLOLm0A","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe PR makes a consistent, minimal version bump in both `Cargo.toml` and the `vig` entry in `Cargo.lock`.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nPrepares the `vig` crate for the v0.6.0 release by bumping the crate version in the Rust package metadata and lockfile so the release workflow can publish the correct version.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Bump `vig` version from `0.5.0` → `0.6.0` in `Cargo.toml`\n- Update the `vig` package entry in `Cargo.lock` to `0.6.0`\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| Cargo.toml | Updates the crate/package version to `0.6.0` for the release. |\r\n| Cargo.lock | Updates the lockfile’s `vig` package entry to match the new version. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-08-28T04:56:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"97ef69551f4ff54b18bd490e97c368b143cef421"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-28T04:59:09Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33143202077/job/98758426797","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-28T04:55:15Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-28T04:55:55Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33143202094/job/98758426684","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-08-28T04:55:15Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-28T04:59:31Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33143397211/job/98759060507","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-08-28T04:59:23Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-28T04:58:05Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33143202077/job/98758426800","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-08-28T04:55:17Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-08-28T04:59:09Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33143202077/job/98758426635","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-08-28T04:55:15Z","status":"COMPLETED","w